            <ArticleTitle>[Innovations in the treatment of severe asthma].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>18-19</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In severe asthma, there is a real need for new effective therapies offering a good safety and tolerance profile. Mepolizumab is a humanized anti-interleukin-5 monoclonal antibody, available in Switzerland since 2016 for treatment of severe adult eosinophilic asthma. Other monoclonal antibodies, such as dupilumab, are being developed in the field of asthma.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
